(8,'8af6dc8b-a3fc-4992-875f-e3ec9b89b111',1,'6c2afc74-ab47-4815-8bff-19a4974c3b9d','Official Launch: OJT Applications Open for 2026-2027','Dear Students,\r\n\r\nWe are pleased to announce that the application window for the On-the-Job Training (OJT) Program is officially open for the upcoming term. \r\n\r\nIMPORTANT DATES & DEADLINES:\r\n• Application Period: Starting October 20, 2026\r\n• Mandatory OJT Orientation: October 17, 2026\r\n\r\nINITIAL REQUIREMENTS FOR SUBMISSION:\r\n1. Letter of Intent (addressed to the OJT Coordinator)\r\n2. Updated Resume / Curriculum Vitae (CV)\r\n3. Certificate of Eligibility / Evaluation of Grades\r\n4. Signed Parent’s/Guardian’s Consent Form\r\n\r\nHOW TO APPLY:\r\nComplete your initial document compilation and submit them directly through the student portal or hand them into the department office. Late submissions will not be accommodated for the primary company matching round.\r\n\r\nFor any inquiries or to view the list of our current accredited industry partners, please contact the OJT Coordination Office or email us at euconnect@email.com.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nSystem Administrator\r\n',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-10-15 14:53:03','2026-10-15 14:53:03',0,0,0),
(9,'30c6db46-c227-4c23-9b48-eff53fe82a1f',1,'fc5e18a8-2b0a-4b12-a226-851058374c65','LOREM IPSUM','lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipiscing elit ut et est excepteur facilis officia distinctio deleniti et laborum libero deleniti duis culpa quo dolorem dolores esse quas et quas dolorem aut soluta in est nostrud exercitation eligendi minus animi et dolor aut et maxime dolor provident incididunt illum et consectetur aute temporibus eum irure qui reprehenderit nobis eum qui maxime qui ducimus dolor sint dolor optio ea commodo deserunt ut veniam animi dolore optio sunt molestias repellendus cillum occaecat excepteur ea ut ut nobis quod ad quibusdam illum do deserunt sint praesentium consectetur magna mollitia ea dolor et lorem iusto','2026-10-27','2026-10-30',0,'2026-10-15 17:09:18','2026-10-15 17:09:18',0,0,0),
(10,'52162710-343a-4e8f-a34c-5e449dfb1945',2,'d172639e-9b53-4857-99c6-e3c29512650f','Hackaton','A hackathon (also known as a hack day, hackfest, datathon or codefest; a portmanteau of hacking and marathon) is an event where people engage in rapid and collaborative engineering over a relatively short period of time, such as 24 or 48 hours in person or several days online. They are often run using agile software development practices, such as sprint-like design wherein computer programmers and others involved in software development, including graphic designers, interface designers, product managers, domain experts, and others collaborate intensively on engineering projects, such as software engineering.','2026-10-26','2026-10-28',1,'2026-10-15 19:33:38','2026-10-15 19:34:16',0,0,0),
(14,'66372755-8776-4f22-a883-38c94033f51d',1,'6c2afc74-ab47-4815-8bff-19a4974c3b9d','Final Defense','System Defense Final Schedule is November 5-6, 2026.',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-10-22 13:24:22','2026-10-22 13:24:22',0,0,0),
(15,'d220bf08-a9b6-4178-8288-a706eae874ed',2,'d6cef874-05e5-4623-b046-1d48449bcf3d','CITHM Internship Event','lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipiscing elit ad aute eu reprehenderit officia nulla do fugiat voluptas consequat aut in sunt esse est proident cupiditate tempore consectetur magna expedita sint assumenda exercitation deleniti magna ea sed est dolores repellendus ex cupidatat commodo similique voluptas sed culpa molestias quos quos omnis','2026-11-05','2026-11-06',1,'2026-10-26 16:49:18','2026-10-26 16:49:50',0,0,0),
