(39,'05c3a35d-584e-4259-ab0f-1ff5c61843f5',1,'fc5e18a8-2b0a-4b12-a226-851058374c65','SYSTEM UPDATE','Your system requires a critical software update to optimize performance, enhance security, and install the latest feature enhancements. This scheduled maintenance will update core operating system files, patch known vulnerabilities, and improve overall system stability. Please save your work and keep your device connected to a power source, as the process may take several minutes and your system will automatically restart to complete the installation.','2026-11-25','2026-11-27',0,'2026-11-04 07:31:55','2026-11-04 07:31:55',1,0,0),
