(35,'c2fe9bbb-0442-449a-a2b7-6ddcac2c8b26','Frequent internet connectivity interruptions or slow workstation performance that delayed task completion.','Shifted to offline tasks like drafting documentation or planning reports whenever the connection dropped.','Ensure that IT assets and infrastructure allocated to interns are fully optimized and updated.',0),
(36,'c2fe9bbb-0442-449a-a2b7-6ddcac2c8b26','Difficulty adjusting to heavy workloads and unfamiliar technical tasks during the initial weeks.','Began breaking tasks down into smaller, manageable milestones and sought clarification immediately when instructions were unclear.','Provide interns with a structured, step-by-step onboarding guide during their first week to ease the transition.',1),
