(561,'ae47309a-31ce-4d8e-a905-c94bc7e2de6d','4a14d552-bfd5-11f1-9638-5bc6d2c76fd7',2,'2026-09-23','2026-09-29','Week 2 Reflection','Demo weekly narrative: During week 2, I completed supervised work as a Technology Intern at Demo BGC Digital Systems Center. I reviewed my tasks with my supervisor and identified skills to improve.','2026-09-30 10:00:00',NULL,NULL),
(581,'d67ff455-04a8-408b-9de0-1c3f6935a838','d2c71cd9-e1cc-4e43-b0e9-1bae4efaf877',3,'2026-09-14','2026-09-20','System Design','System design is the structured process of defining a system\'s architecture, components, and data flow to satisfy specific business requirements. It relies on core infrastructure pieces like load balancers, databases, caches, and message queues to manage traffic and data efficiently. Engineers must prioritize key principles such as scalability, reliability, and high availability to ensure the platform handles growth without crashing. Balancing these priorities requires navigating critical trade-offs, famously outlined by the CAP theorem, which states a distributed system can only guarantee two out of three pillars: consistency, availability, and partition tolerance. Ultimately, mastering these foundational concepts is essential whether you are building real-world software or preparing for a technical system design interview.','2026-10-05 19:47:40','2026-10-08 01:47:55',NULL),
(586,'ad760dbb-12ba-4308-b8f5-29fae4cb01cc','2995a6d2-2371-4127-8841-dd2cf87dae27',1,'2026-10-12','2026-10-18','Onboarding and Orientation','During my first week at the company, I focused heavily on onboarding, setting up my workspace, and reviewing training materials. I attended a team orientation meeting where my supervisor introduced me to everyone and outlined the main objectives for my internship. It was exciting to learn about the company\'s workflow, though adjusting to the new professional environment was a bit overwhelming at first. By the end of the week, I felt much more comfortable navigating the office and understanding my initial daily responsibilities.','2026-10-14 09:50:40','2026-10-14 09:55:09',NULL),
(587,'ad760dbb-12ba-4308-b8f5-29fae4cb01cc','2995a6d2-2371-4127-8841-dd2cf87dae27',2,'2026-10-19','2026-10-25','Core Task Integration','This week, I officially transitioned into my core daily responsibilities, which primarily involved [mention a task, e.g., managing database entries / analyzing competitor metrics]. I spent time learning the company\'s internal software and shadowing a senior team member to see how they handle live projects. My supervisor gave me my first independent assignment, which allowed me to apply my academic knowledge to practical corporate tasks. I am still finding my rhythm with time management, but I feel increasingly confident in my handling of the workflow.','2026-10-14 09:55:24',NULL,NULL),
(588,'ad760dbb-12ba-4308-b8f5-29fae4cb01cc','2995a6d2-2371-4127-8841-dd2cf87dae27',3,'2026-10-26','2026-11-01','Project Collaboration','Week three was centered around teamwork as I was assigned to assist a cross-functional group with an ongoing project. I actively participated in project syncs and contributed to [mention a specific contribution, e.g., preparing the weekly slide deck / drafting content drafts]. Collaborating closely with colleagues from different departments gave me a clearer understanding of how the company operates as a whole. This experience highlighted the massive value of open communication and flexibility when managing shared deadlines.','2026-10-14 09:55:39',NULL,NULL),
(589,'ad760dbb-12ba-4308-b8f5-29fae4cb01cc','2995a6d2-2371-4127-8841-dd2cf87dae27',4,'2026-11-02','2026-11-08','Overcoming Challenges','This week presented a few unexpected technical difficulties and tight deadlines that tested my problem-solving skills. I encountered a minor setback while working on [mention a challenge, e.g., a data discrepancy / a software bug], which required me to research solutions independently before asking a teammate for advice. By prioritizing my task queue and staying focused, I successfully resolved the issue and delivered my assignments on time. Overcoming this hurdle taught me a lot about resilience and managing professional pressure.','2026-10-14 09:55:54',NULL,NULL),
(590,'ad760dbb-12ba-4308-b8f5-29fae4cb01cc','2995a6d2-2371-4127-8841-dd2cf87dae27',5,'2026-11-09','2026-11-15','Final Evaluation and Reflection','In my final week, I wrapped up all my remaining project deliverables and organized my files to ensure a smooth transition for the team. I had a formal wrap-up meeting with my supervisor to review my performance and receive constructive feedback on my work. It was highly rewarding to hear their positive remarks regarding my dedication and adaptability over the past month. Looking back, this entire experience has significantly boosted my confidence and clarified my career goals moving forward.','2026-10-14 09:56:06',NULL,NULL),
(591,'ad760dbb-12ba-4308-b8f5-29fae4cb01cc','2995a6d2-2371-4127-8841-dd2cf87dae27',6,'2026-11-16','2026-11-22','Increasing Autonomy','With the first half of my internship complete, my supervisor granted me more independence this week by allowing me to manage [mention a specific task, e.g., client follow-ups / daily data verification] completely on my own. I focused heavily on streamlining my personal workflow to handle these new responsibilities without needing constant supervision. Taking full ownership of these tasks was highly rewarding and significantly boosted my professional confidence. By Friday, I successfully hit all my independent targets ahead of schedule.','2026-10-14 09:56:57','2026-10-14 09:57:05',NULL),
(592,'ad760dbb-12ba-4308-b8f5-29fae4cb01cc','2995a6d2-2371-4127-8841-dd2cf87dae27',7,'2026-11-23','2026-11-29','Mid-Term Review and Refinement','This week was centered around analyzing my progress so far and identifying areas where I can refine my skill set. I sat down with my supervisor for a mid-term review, where we discussed what I have done well and what skills I still need to develop. Based on their constructive feedback, I spent the remaining days focusing on improving my [mention a skill, e.g., technical reporting / software efficiency]. It was an incredibly motivating week that gave me a clear roadmap for the remainder of my practicum.','2026-10-14 09:57:18',NULL,NULL),
(593,'ad760dbb-12ba-4308-b8f5-29fae4cb01cc','2995a6d2-2371-4127-8841-dd2cf87dae27',8,'2026-11-30','2026-12-06','Advanced Project Inflow','Week eight introduced a higher volume of work as our department entered a busy operational phase. I was tasked with supporting a high-priority project, which required me to learn advanced features of [mention a tool, e.g., Excel / the company CRM / development tools] on short notice. Managing this increased workload alongside my daily routine forced me to strictly organize my schedule and eliminate distractions. Despite the fast pace, our team met every major milestone, and I felt proud of my ability to keep up.','2026-10-14 09:57:32',NULL,NULL),
(594,'ad760dbb-12ba-4308-b8f5-29fae4cb01cc','2995a6d2-2371-4127-8841-dd2cf87dae27',9,'2026-12-07','2026-12-13','Peer Mentorship and Knowledge Sharing','This week, I had the unique opportunity to help a newer team member get acclimated to some of our department\'s daily routines. Explaining the workflow and software shortcuts to someone else actually helped reinforce my own understanding of our internal systems. Outside of training, I focused on compiling my ongoing research and data into a final comprehensive summary. It was incredibly fulfilling to realize just how much knowledge I have absorbed since my very first day on the job.','2026-10-14 09:57:45',NULL,NULL),
(595,'ad760dbb-12ba-4308-b8f5-29fae4cb01cc','2995a6d2-2371-4127-8841-dd2cf87dae27',10,'2026-12-14','2026-12-20','Internship Closure and Handover','My final week was dedicated to wrapping up loose ends, finalizing all pending reports, and preparing a handover document for the team. I cleaned up my digital workspace and ensured all my project files were organized and easily accessible for my colleagues. During my final exit interview, my supervisor and peers shared incredibly kind parting words about my contributions to the office. Leaving the organization felt bittersweet, but I am walking away with sharp new skills and a much clearer vision for my future career.','2026-10-14 09:57:58','2026-11-04 10:09:39',NULL),
(598,'6e11697b-f6d3-4a3f-a4d9-e113b583c5ac','4a14c978-bfd5-11f1-9638-5bc6d2c76fd7',5,'2026-10-04','2026-10-11','Week 5 Reflection','Demo weekly narrative: In week 4 at Demo Central Luzon Community Development Center, I tested software changes, documented issues, and practiced debugging. My supervisor reviewed the work, and I noted skills to improve next week.','2026-10-27 17:02:37','2026-10-27 17:03:05',NULL),
(601,'54f32ce5-843d-4f01-a3a8-23699dab620d','4a14c547-bfd5-11f1-9638-5bc6d2c76fd7',5,'2026-09-02','2026-09-04','Food and Beverage','Food and beverage (F&B) service is the commercial or non-commercial process of preparing, presenting, and serving food and drinks to customers. It spans the global hospitality and dining industries, connecting agriculture, manufacturing, logistics, and guest experiences.','2026-11-04 06:03:58',NULL,'[{\"id\":\"bceeb76c-d1d7-11f1-be10-ccb93e076b05\",\"department_name\":\"Guest Relations\",\"supervisor_name\":\"Demo Supervisor A\",\"date_from\":\"2026-09-02\",\"date_to\":\"2026-09-04\"}]'),
